      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Chroma Key cuts one Key Color out of a picture and shows its Background through the hole. The green-screen shot here is a turning Star on pure green, and the Background is a gradient sky. Turn Threshold and Softness; to key a camera, cable a Main Input's Frame into Input and pick its Key Color."
        }
